# gg-lint rules

| ID | Name | Severity | Summary |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| R1 | no-dot-imports | warning | flags dot imports |
| R2 | require-package-doc | error | requires a package doc comment |

## R1: no-dot-imports

Severity: warning

Dot imports pollute the namespace and hide where a name comes from.

## R2: require-package-doc

Severity: error

Every package needs a leading doc comment describing its purpose.

